Package: howslifepipeline
Type: Project
Title: Automated Refresh, QA and Environmental Well-being Analysis for the OECD How's Life? Database
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Lolita", "Muller", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "lolita.muller26@gmail.com")
Description: Fetches the OECD How's Life? well-being database and the OECD
    city-level climate, environment and demographic dataflows from the SDMX API,
    validates them, tracks changes between vintages, and builds a risk-based
    environmental well-being indicator with an explicit hazard / exposure /
    vulnerability / adaptive-capacity structure.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
